PNV 1
EPISTEMIC CHYBA
MODE INTERNAL_EXECUTION
# Author: effective half-time = 2pi; full time = 4pi.
# THETA is unwrapped phase advance in units of pi, not an external clock.
OP OBJECT SOURCE now.object
OP HOTEL IDENTITY NONE
OP WINDING IDENTITY 0
OP SIGN IDENTITY 1
OP THETA IDENTITY 0
OP INDEX IDENTITY WINDING
OP NOW COMPOSITION HOTEL NONE WINDING SIGN THETA OBJECT
EMIT HOTEL
EMIT NOW
EMIT INDEX
EMIT WINDING
EMIT SIGN
EMIT THETA
